<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS5.SSS2" title="In IV-E Experiment Results ‣ IV Experiments ‣ Can SSD-Mamba2 Unlock Reinforcement Learning for End-to-End Motion Control?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-E</span>2 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation: Effect of Multi-Modality</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS5.SSS3" title="In IV-E Experiment Results ‣ IV Experiments ‣ Can SSD-Mamba2 Unlock Reinforcement Learning for End-to-End Motion Control?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-E</span>3 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation: Effect of the Fusion Backbone</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS5.SSS4" title="In IV-E Experiment Results ‣ IV Experiments ‣ Can SSD-Mamba2 Unlock Reinforcement Learning for End-to-End Motion Control?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-E</span>4 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Generalization to Unseen Conditions</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
