</section>
<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Training schema.</h5>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All policies are trained with PPO using on-policy rollouts of length <math id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, minibatch updates over multiple epochs, advantage normalization, and gradient clipping. Terrain and appearance randomization are applied at episode resets, and an obstacle-density curriculum gradually increases task difficulty. The overall training procedure is outlined in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Obstacle-density curriculum. ‣ IV-C Implementation Details ‣ IV Experiments ‣ Can SSD-Mamba2 Unlock Reinforcement Learning for End-to-End Motion Control?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Shared PPO hyperparameters are listed in Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="TABLE II ‣ Training schema. ‣ IV-C Implementation Details ‣ IV Experiments ‣ Can SSD-Mamba2 Unlock Reinforcement Learning for End-to-End Motion Control?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">II</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE II</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">PPO hyperparameters.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T2.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T2.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Episode horizon (steps)</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">999</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Samples per iteration</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">16,384</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Minibatch size</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1,024</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Optimization epochs per update</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">3</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Discount factor <math id="S4.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.99</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">GAE parameter <math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.95</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">PPO clip parameter <math id="S4.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.2</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Entropy coefficient</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.005</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Policy learning rate</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="S4.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Value learning rate</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="S4.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Optimizer</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Adam</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.5.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.5.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Activation function</td>
<td id="S4.T2.5.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">ReLU</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Domain randomization.</h5>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To improve robustness and transferability, physics parameters are randomized at the beginning of each episode <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">44</a>]</cite>. Unless stated otherwise, the sampled values remain fixed throughout the episode. Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="TABLE III ‣ Domain randomization. ‣ IV-C Implementation Details ‣ IV Experiments ‣ Can SSD-Mamba2 Unlock Reinforcement Learning for End-to-End Motion Control?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">III</span></a> lists the randomized ranges.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE III: </span>Domain randomization ranges.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T3.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T3.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T3.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Parameter</span></th>
