                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
                
                
                Compute advantages <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{A}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{A}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> with GAE, normalize, and compute returns <math id="alg1.l18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{R}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{R}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
                
                
                <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> epoch <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>E</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
